<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc1">PITAA Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Pita</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pit</para>
  <para style="mt1">PITAA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cayuk Akcüknak</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Pitaa Cayuk Akcüknak </char> hin Asah khawa sip da ngpyeng hükie “Pamhnama jah xüa khyang” tia ami jah sui khritjanea vei a yuka kyaki. A yuknak üng a jah mtheh hlü ktung ta, ami jumeinaka phäh khuikhanak ja mkhuimkhanak ami khameia phäh a jah mcuhmcäinaka kyaki. Jesuh Khritawa a thihnak, a thawhnak be ja a law be vaia khyütame naw äpeinak jah peki tia Thangkdaw cun a jah sümsak benaka kyaki. Ahin ksingnaka phäh üng, ami khuikhanak cun dunei khawh u lü doei khawh khaie. Ami jumeinak akcang mä tia mhnütnaka mkhüh üpnak ja “Jesuh Khritawa law bea Mhnüp” üng ngkhyengnak yah khai tia mkhüh üpnak jah peki. (1:7)</para>
  <para style="ip">Khuikhanaka kcün üng a jah mcuhmcäinak am atänga, a kca yuknak khyange üng Khritaw üng sängeikia kba ami xüngsei vaia pi jah mthehki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pamhnama küikyannak a jah sümsak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngcingcaihkia xüngsei vaia mthümhletnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13—2:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khuikhanaka kcün üng Khritjana mta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11—4:19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khritjana mlung mhnemnak ja khut bi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khüpnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Jesuh Khritawa ngsä Pita üngkhyüha,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Pontas hne, Kalatih hne, Kappadokih hne, Asah hne ja Bithuniha hnee üng pekce khyanga kba ngpyeng lü ve hükie, Pamhnama sakhyangea veia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Jesuh Khritaw läklam lü a thisen am ning jah ngcimsak se, a Ngmüimkhya Ngcim am khyang ngcima ning jah pyang lü Pa Pamhnama hlüeia a ning jah xü pänga nami kyaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Bäkhäknak ja dimdeihnak cun nami khana hläipyam lü ve se.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xüngseikia Äpeinak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Jesuh Khritaw thihnak üngkhyüh a mthawh bea phäh, a mpyeneinak dämduh lü sak kthai ja xüngseikia äpeinak a jah pet ni. Acuna phäh mi Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa Pa ja a Pamhnam hin mi mhlünmtai vai u. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Pamhnam naw a khyanga phäh a jah cüm peta dawkyanak kümcei cun kanak khaia ma da kami tengki. Ani naw acune cun käh thuuih cimpye khyükhleih thei khaia khankhawa a ning jah tak pet ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Acun he cun: akpäihnaka khawmhnüp üng mdan vaia küikyannak, Pamhnama johit am ami jumeinak üngkhyüh jah thupa khyangea phäh jah tak pet ni.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Acuna phäh nami jekyaikie. Cunüngpi, khuikhanak mjüküm nami khameia phäh atuh hin asängca nami pukset vai hlü taw khai. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Acun cun nami jumeinak hin cangki aw tia ami mhnütnak hlüa phäh ni. Pyüpye theikia xüi pi mei üng mhnüta kyaki. Acuna kthaka daw bawk lü am pyüpye theikia nami jumeinak pi mhnüt yah vai. Acunüng Jesuh Khritaw a law bea Mhnüp üng hlüngtainak, mhlünmtainak ja leisawngnak nami yah khai. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Ani cun am hmu khawi kyaw uki lüpi, nami mhläkphyanaki. Atuh hin am hmu kyaw uki lüpi, nami jumeiki. Mpyawng üng am pyen theia jekyainak k’hlüngtai am nami jekyaiki. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>Isenitiüng ta, ani nami jumeinak üng nami büa nami ngmüimkhya küikyannak nami yaha phäh ni.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Pamhnam naw ahina küikyannak a ning jah pet vai cun sahma he naw angsingtea mcek lü suihjap lü ana pyen pängki he . <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Khritawa Ngmüimkhya cun ami k’uma ve lü Khritawa khamei vaia khuikhanaka suilam ja hlüngtainak a yah vai cun jah mhnüh lü ana pyenki. Acunakyase, Khritaw cun ihawkba law be khai, itia law be khai ti cun suihjapkie. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Pamhnam naw sahma he naw ami khut bi cen amimäta phäh am ni. Nangmia phäh ni tia khankhaw üngka naw jah tüih lawa ngsäe, Ngmüimkhya Ngcima johit am Thangkdaw sangkie, naw ami pyen cen nami ngjakie. Ahina mawnge ni khankhawngsäe naw pi ngjakkya vai ami ngaih.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngcingcaihnak am xüngsei khaia khü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Acunakyase, khut bi am nami mdan vaia nami mlung pitpyang ua. Jesuh Khritaw a ngdang law be üng, ning jah pet vai dawkyanaka khana nami äpeinak kümcei cun ta lü thüxak lü a na ngcüngcei ua. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Pamhnama ngthu läklam ua. Mawngcei lü nami ve ham üng, am dawkyakia nami xüngseia mäiha, nami xünsak käh ning jah up be ti kawm. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Acuna kthaka ta, ning jah khükia Pamhnam a ngcingcaih mäih kunga kba nami bilawh naküt üng ngcingcaih lü ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Cangcim üng, “Kei ka ngcingcaihkia kyase ngcingcaih ua” ti lü a pyen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Lev 11:44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Hmai käh teng lü khyang naküt a pawha kba angteha ngthu mtaiki Pamhnama veia nami ktaiyü üng, ka Pa nami tiki. Acunakyase, khawmdek khana nami xün k’um üng ani leisawng lü ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Nami pupa üngkhyüh ia käh ngtähkia xüngseinak üngka naw ning jah thawngkhyah ni. Pyüpye lü khyükhleih theikia ngui xüi am ning jah thawng am ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>Ia mkhyenak käh ve lü am lembawikia toca am tängki Khritaw thisen küi am ning jah thawngkhyah cun ksing ua. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Khawmdeka am a ngtüi ham üngkhyüh ani cun Pamhnam naw a xü päng ni. Ahina akpäihnaka khawmhnüpe üng, nami phäha ngdang lawki. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Thihnak üngkhyüh mtho be lü hlüngtainak ani üng peki Pamhnam cun ani üngkhyüh nami jumeikia kyase, nami jumeinak ja äpeinak cun Pamhnam üng nami taki.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Atuh ta ngthungtak nami läklamnak üng namimät ngcingcaihsakei ve uki. Acunakyase, nami khritjanpüi mhläkphyanak ja, mat ja mat mlung kcang naküt am mhläkphya na ua. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Pyüpye theiki am ni lü, käh pyüpye theikia mci ui, angsäia xüng lü mäkia Pamhnama ngthu am nami hmi be pängki ni. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Cangcim naw<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Hesa 40:6-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Khyang nghngicim naküt cun msaia kba ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">ami hlüngtainake pi mawa ka khyeipai hea kba ni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Msai cun ngjai lü, khyeipai pi kyüki ni,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>cunüngpi, Bawipaa ngthu ta angsäia mäki” ti lü pyenki.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Ahina ngthu hin nami veia sang lawa Thangkdaw ni.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Xüngseikia lung ja ngcimcaihkia khyangmjü</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Acunakyase, mkhyenak naküt, hleihlaknak naküt, ngsaihnak naküt, ngkeingkünak naküt ja pyenksenak mjüküm jah hawih ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Hmi law thaiki hnasena kba, ngmüimkhya cihtui ngcim aläa cawixai lü ve ua. Acunüng va, acun eiaw lü dämduh law lü küikyannak nami yah khai. <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>Cangcim naw a pyena kba, “Bawipa ihlawka akcanga dawki ti cun namimät naw nami cayah pängki.” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Sal 34:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Khyang he naw ia käh mawngmeikia ngai lü ami ma. Cunüngpi, Pamhnam naw aphu küia a xü päng, xüngseikia lung Bawipaa veia law ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Nangmi pi xüngseikia lunga kya u lü, ngmüimkhya üng sängeikia im sawngsaknak üng sumei ua. Acuna im üng ktaiyü ngcime naw Jesuh Khritawa ngming am Pamhnama veia ngmüimkhya üng sängeikia ngkengnak ami petnak vai hnüna kyaki. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Cangcim üng<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Hesa 28:16</ref> (LXX)</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Aphu küi lung ka xü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Zion mcunga aphungnua ka tak;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">Ani jumeiki naküt cun itia pi käh hmaiset khai” ti lü veki.<verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Ahina lung nami jumeikie phäh ta aphu kdäm yah khaie. Cunüngpi, am jumeikiea phäh ta:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sal 118:22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">ia am mawngkia ngai lü imksae naw ami nawt hüa lung cun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">aphungnu ktunga thawn law khawiki.<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Cangcim naw a pyen betü ta:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Hesa 8:14-15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Ahina lung ni khyange jah ngsukeisaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">khyange jah kyukngpäsakia lung.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Ngthu am ami juma phäh ni ami ngsukei; acun ni Pamhnam naw ami phäha a hlüei.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Cunüngpi, nangmi ta ning jah xüa khyangmjü, Sangpuxanga ktaiyü he, ngcingcaihkia khyange ja amät Pamhnama sakhyange ni. Pamhnama müncankse khute jah sang khaia, anghmüp khui üngkhyüh amäta müncan phyakia akvai üng ning jah khü be lü a ning jah xü päng ni.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5">Ex 19:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Hesa 43:20</ref> (LXX); <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Ex 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Deut 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Hesa 9:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Ahlana ta Pamhnama khyanga am kya uki. Atuh ta ania khyanga nami kyaki. Ahlana ta Pamhnama mpyeneinak am ksing uki. Atuh ta a mpyeneinak nami yaheiki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama mpyae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Ka püi he aw, khawmdek khana khin ja pekce khyanga kba ning jah nghui na veng. Aläa ngmüimkhya ngtäkpüiki mtisa hlükaw naküt hjawng ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Am jumeikiea ksunga nami pawh naküt akdawa pawh ua. Akse pawhkia khyange ami ning jah tinaka kcün üng, akdaw nami pawh cun süm be lü a law bea Khawmhnüp üng Pamhnam ami mküimto vaia phäh ni.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Khyang nghngicima ana naküt Bawipaa ngminga phäh jah läklam ua. Ana ak’hlüng säih taki Emperoa pyen läklam ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>Akdaw pawhki mküiei lü akse pawhki kcet khaia Empero naw a jah mcawn mlüh ukea mtheh pi jah läklam ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Khyang kseea am dawkia ngthu ami pyen cun akdaw nami pawhnak naw a jah him vai Pamhnam naw hlüei ve. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Lätnak yahki khyanga kba nami xüngsekie ni. Cunüngpi, nami lätlangnak cen akse thupnak vaia käh sumei lü, Pamhnama mpyaa kba ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Khyang naküt leisawng ua, nami khritjanpüi mhläkphya na ua. Pamhnam kyüh lü Empero pi leisawng ua.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritawa khuikhanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Mpyae aw, leisawngnak am nami bawi veia ng’apei ua. Khyang kdaw ja khyang k’hniphnawiea ma däka am ni lü, khyang mlung k’ngyatea veia pi acukba ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Pamhnama hlüei nami dangyaha phäh am khamei vai sükyaw nami khamei üng, acuna phäh Pamhnam naw dawkyanak ning jah pe khai. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Nami mkhyenaka phäh mkhuimkhanak nami dunei üng, i ni nami yah. Cunüngpi, akdaw nami pawha phäh mkhuimkhanak nami dunei üng, Pamhnam naw dawkyanak ning jah pe khai. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Ahina phäh ni Pamhnam naw a ning jah khü. Khritaw naw a khawleh üng nglehei lü ani üng nami ngcuhngkih vaia nami phäha khuikhanak khamki. <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>Ani cun naw ia mkhyenak pi am pawh. A mpyawng üng hlei a pyen pi u naw am ngja khawi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Hesa 53:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Khyang he naw mdihmsui u lü pi, am jah mdihmsui be. Ami mkhuimkha üngpi, am jah mkyühmkyawk be. Ania äpeinak cun ngtäikia ngthumkhyahki Pamhnam üng taki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Hesa 53:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Mkhyenak üng mi thi lü, ngsungpyunak üng mi xün vaia, mi mkhyenake Khritaw amät naw a pum üng phüi lü kutlamktunga a cehpüi ni. A nghmalem am yainak mi yahki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Hesa 53:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Toa mäiha lam nami hmüki cen, atuh ta ning jah msümceiki Toksäm ja nami ngmüimkhya ning jah Sämbänkia veia nami law beki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Hesa 53:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Khyungcei awmih ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Acuna kba ni, nghnumie aw, nami ceiea mtheh ngja ua. Nami ceie naw Pamhnama ngthu am ami jum üng, i nami pyen vai käh hlükia dawkyakia nami ngneisak naw jumei law khaiea jah pyang khai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Eph 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>Isenitiüng, nami ngneisak hin ihlawka ngcingcaih lü leisawng phyaki ti cun ksing khaie. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Nami lusam phan lü ngui xüi jah awi hnak ja suisak kdaw nami suijih am akhawkpung ning jah ngtongtaisak khai cen käh sumei ua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1Tim 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Acuna nghnün üng, nami mlung k’uma käh hngalang theikia ngtongtainaka kyaki hniphnawinak ja mlung kdip üng ngtongtai ua. Pamhnama hmuha ngtongtainak akdaw säih ta acun ni. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Ahlana Pamhnam üng ami äpeinak ta lü Pamhnam jumeikia nghnumie naw, ami ceia mtheh ngjaknak üng amimät ngtongtaisak khawikie. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Sarah naw pi acukba ve lü: Abrahama mtheh ngja lü, ka bawi aw ti lü khüki. Nangmi hin akdawa ve lü kyükyawknak am a ve üng ta, Saraha canghnuea nami kyaki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Gen 18:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Acuna kba ni, nangmi kpamie pi nami nghnumie cun pumsa ktha ngcekie ti ksing lü sitih am jah vepüi ua. Nami ktaiyü üng i naw käh a ning jah kyawh vaia, Pamhnama jah pet angsäia xünnak nang am atänga yah hnga khaia kyase, jah leisawng ua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Eph 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akcang pawha phäh khuikhanak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Akpäihnaka, mlung mat ngaihnak mat üng ve ua. Ngbengnaa kba nami püi mhläkphya na ua. Nami püi mpyeneinak ja mlung mhnemnak am ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Akse, akse am; yünsenak pi yünsenak am käh thungei be ua. Dawkyanak am thung be ua. Isenitiüng, dawkyanak cun a ning jah khüa kcün üng a ning jah pet vaia Pamhnama bekhüta kyaki. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Cangcim naw<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Sal 34:12-16</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Jenaka xünsak hlüei lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">kcün kdawe jah hmuha yüki naw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">akse pyennak ja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">hlei pyennak jah hawih yah khai.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Akse pawhnak üngkhyüh nghlat lü akdaw pawh se;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">dimdeihnak sui lü acun läk hü se.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Bawipa naw khyang ngsungpyune jah teng lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">ami ktaiyünak pi jah ngai ve;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">cunüngpi, akse pawhkie ta jah nghei ta ve.<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Akcang pawh vaia na ngtäng üng u naw ning mhlembawi khai ni. <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Cunüngpi, akcang na pawha phäh na khuikha vai üngpi, nami josenki. U pi käh kyüh ua, käh cäicing ua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mt 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Hesa 8:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Nami mlung k’uma Khritaw leisawng lü Bawipa mäih leisawng ua. Nangmi naw nami taka äpeinaka mawng ning jah kthähki a ve üng, nami jah mtheh ngkyai be thei vaia, aläa ngsüngcei ua. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Hniphnawinak ja leisawngnak am bi ua. Khritawa hnukläka nami thawna phäh akdaw nami pawh üng, ning jah kse na lü ning jah yaihyüneikie naw ami pyen am ngkeeinaka thawn khaia, nami cungaihnak ngcingcaihsak ua. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Akdaw pawh lü nami khuikha cun Pamhnama hlüei ani üngta, akse pawh lü nami khuikha kthaka ta daw bawk ve. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Pamhnama veia a ning jah ceh hlüpüia phäh khyangkaea nghnün üng khyang kdaw Khritaw cun mkhyenakea phäh thiki. Ahun a thih cun angläta phäha kyaki. Pumsa lama thihnak khamki, cunüngpi ngmüimkhya lam üng xünsak be pängki. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Acuna ngmüimkhya pumsa am cit lü thawng üng ami jah khyum ngmüimkhyaea veia ngthu pyenki. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Acuna ngmüimkhyae ta, Nawe naw mlawng a saka kcün üng mlung msaü lü jah k’äihei kyaw sepi Pamhnama mtheh am ngjakia ngmüimkhyae ni. Nawea mlawng am khyang khyet mlikpitui üngka naw jah küikyana kyaki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Gen 6:1—7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Acuna tui cun atuh ning jah küikyanki baptican tia msingnak ni. Acun cun nami pumsa lelawiki mthihnak am ni lü, akdaw ksingnak üngkhyüh Pamhnama veia khyütam pawhnaka kyaki. Acun naw Jesuh Khritaw cun thihnak üngkhyüh a thawhnak be naw ning jah küikyanki. <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>Jesuh cun khankhawa kai be pängki. Khankhawngsäe naküt ja khankhaw johite ja khyaihbahnake cun jah up lü Pamhnama khet da ngawki.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ngthunghlaikia xünsak kthai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Khritaw naw a pumsa am khuikhanak khameiki. Nangmi pi a Ania khameia kba nami khamei khai kunga ngai lü, nami ktha mcüng ua. Isenitiüng, Pumsa khuikhanak khamei nakütki cun mkhyenak üng am ngpüi ti tinaka kyaki. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Tuh üngkhyüha ta, khawmdek ning üng na xünseinak naküt cen, khyanga hlüeia käh nikia, Pamhnama hlüeia xüngsei hnüha. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Mi khe lawa kcüne üng am jumeikiea kba: mlung hlükaw jawnga awmih, hnunglanak hlü, jukung ktaipam xanak, ampyua ei aw lü hnungla pawia awmih, juhai eiawknak ja mtuihsekia juktuhe hjawkmkhähnake cun nami khyaih khawha nami jah pawh pängki he . <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Atuh ta Mhnam am ksingki hea mlung xanak ja mlümlawknak üng am nami ngpüingpaw tia phäh, mün u lü ning jah yaihei ve u. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Acunüngpi, akthi ja akxüng ngthu jah mtai khaia ngcüngceiki Pamhnama veia amimäta mawng cun pyenei yah khaie. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Acuna phäh ni, khyang naküta khameia kba ngthumkhyahnak cun pumsa üng khameikie akthiea veia pi Thangkdaw cun sanga kyaki. Pamhnam a xüngseia mäiha ngmüimkhya üng ami xüisei vaia phäh sanga kyaki.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama jah pet msümceiei thei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Anaküta adütnak vai cun cäh lawki. Acunakyase, nami ktaiyü khawh vaia, mlung ngkhängsak lü thüxaknak am ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Anaküta kthaka nami püi mhläkphya na ua. Mhläkphyanak naw mkhyenak khawhah jah küm pet theiki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Ngthk 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Käh hlawpcap lü nami püi khin na thei ua. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Khyang mat phäh phäh hin Pamhnama jah pet ami phäh phäha msümceikia kyaki he. Pamhnam naw letsawnga a pet cun khyang kce hea phäh daw khaia sumei se. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Ngthu sangkia khyang naküt naw Pamhnama ngthu sang se. Khut bikia khyang naküt naw Pamhnama peta ngjuktha am khut bi se. Acunüng va, anaküt üng Pamhnam cun Jesuh Khritawa phäh üng mhlünmtaia kya khai. Johit ja hlüngtainak cun angsäia Pamhnama kaa kyaki. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khritjana kya lü khuikha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Ka püi he aw, nami khana am thawn khawiki pha law lü ning jah huimhleikia mhnütnaka nami khamei üng käh müncan ua. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Khritawa khuikhatnak nami khameipüi hin jekyai ua. Hlüngtainak am a law bea kcün üng, jekyainak am nami kümcei khaia kyase. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Khritawa hnukläka nami kyaa phäh ami ning jah yaihyünei üng ta, jekyai ua. Acun cun hlüngtaikia Ngmüimkhya, Pamhnama Ngmüimkhya cun nami khana vekia kyaki. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Nangmi üng mat naw a khuikhatnak a khamei üng; khyang a hnima phäh, a mpyuka phäh, khyangkaa a thawna phäh ja khyanga khut üng a ngcawngcik hüa phäha, käh khamei se. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Acunüngpi, Khritjana na thawna phäh khuikhatnak na khamei üngta, käh ngkeei kawpi. Khritawa ngming üng na khameia phäh Pamhnam na jenak vai.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Ngthumkhyahnak cutei vaia kcün cun pha päng ve. Pamhnama a khyange cun akcüka jah cijang vai. Mimi üng a cutei üng, Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawkia Thangkdaw am jumeikiea khütnak vai ta ihawkba vai ni. <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Cangcim naw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Ngthk 11:31</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“khyang kdawe jah küikyan vai hin khak ve;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">acunüng, Mhnam am jumki khyangkae ta ihawkba vai ni.”<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Acunakyase, Pamhnama hlüeia khuikhat khameikie naw, a khyütam nängpang lü jah Tüipyangkia veia, dawkyakia ngneisak am ami xünsak cun ng’apei u se.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s">Pamhnama Tome pä</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Kei sangcim ngvai, Khritawa khuikhanak ka mik am hmu lü a ngdang law bea kcün üng hlüngtainak yah hnga khai naw nami ksunga sangcim ngvai jah nghui na veng. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Toksäm naw a toe a jah msümceia mäiha, nami msümcei vaia Pamhnam naw a ning jah pet cen jah msümcei ua. Msümcei vaia mta a nia phäh am ni lü, Pamhnam jesak khaia mlung am bi ua. Ngui yahnak hlüa mlung am käh nikia, Pamhnama phäh khut binak hlüa mlung kcang üng bi ua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Jn 21:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Nami jah msümceiea khana ngvai kawlaiha käh yäng u lü ami ning jah ngcuhngkihnak vaia ve ua. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Toksäm Ngvai säih a law be üng, a vainak käh khyük theikia hlüngtaikia lukhüm nami ngbung law khai.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Acuna kba ni, nangmi athawie naw akdämea mtheh ngja ua. Nami püia maa mlung mhnemnak ta ua. Cangcim naw, “A mlung dämki Pamhnam naw khyah lü, mlung mhnemki jäk ve” a ti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Ngthk 3:34</ref> (LXX)</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Khyaihbahkia Pamhnama kut kea ve lü nami mlung mhnem ua. Amäta kcün a pha law üng, ning jah mhlünmtai khai.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mt 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Nami cäicing pyangmanak naküt Pamhnam üng ap ua. Isenitiüng, ani naw ning jah msümceiki ni.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Thüxak lü mceiei ua. Nami yepa Khawyai cun hengsiha kba huk lü a mjaw vai sui lü cit hüki. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Nami jumeinak am ngkhängcek lü ani cen sungkham ua. Isenitiüng, khawmdek khan abäng üng, nami khritjanpüi he pi nangmia khamei mäiha khuikhanak khameikie ti nami ksingki. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Acukba khuikhanak asäng nami khamei käna, Khritaw üng yümmatnak am angsäia a hlüngtainak yah hnga khaia ning jah khüki Pamhnama bäkhäknak naw ning jah kümceisak khai. Ning jah ngkhängpangsak lü ngjuktha ning jah pe khai. Acun käna, ngkhängkia ngleheinak am ning jah ngdüihsak khai. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Johit cun angsäia ania kaa kyase. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnaka hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Ahina kca ktawica hin Tilah naw na kpüi se ka yuk law ni. Ani hin sitihkia mi khritjanpüia ka ngaiki. Ahin hin Pamhnama bäkhäknak akcang tia ka saksi lü ka ning jah mcuhmcäi hlüki. Acun üng ngkhängpang ua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Ngs 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Pamhnam naw a khü hnga Babalunga veki sangcim naw pi ning jah hnukset ve. Ka ca Makuh naw pi ning jah hnukset ve.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Ngs 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phil 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Nami khritjanpüi mhläkphyanak am mat ja mat hnuksetei ua.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Khritaw üng sängeiki naküta veia dimdeihnak ve se.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
